  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nAre you a quadrober?<p></p>\n<p>Welcome to a world where the boundary between reality and fantasy blurs! “Quadrober Simulator” offers a unique adventure in the skin of a virtual beast combining the features of a dog, fox or cat.</p>\n<p>Become part of the amazing life of Quadrober, have fun, have fun and explore this amazing world. Take the challenge and show how much you can rein in this comical and exciting story!</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Memes and Culture</b>: Explore a virtual world full of modern youth memes and become a part of this subculture. Turn others into quadrobers to have more fun together.\n</li><li><b>Social Clashes</b>: Try your hand at exciting fights with scoofs and try to emerge victorious from various comical situations.\n</li><li><b>Humor and Irony</b>: The game is filled with apt jokes and comical situations that will make you laugh until you cry.\n</li><li><b>Unique approach</b>: Ordinary actions are turned into exciting mini-games and adventures.\n</li><li><b>Sarcastic look at the routine</b>: The game offers to see the usual things in a different light and to remember that even in everyday life you can find something funny and amazing.\n</li></ul>\n",
